 StyleBox["fib", "TI"],
 "]. Drawing coordinates belong to this result; the fibered graph itself \
remains unchanged."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c3669fb1-cf10-4d1b-8b7c-93121fc18f4f"],

